  "body": "Microsoft [states](http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/windows/hardware/gg463195.aspx) that: \n\n> Note: For PCI, PC Card, USB, and IEEE 1394 devices, Vendor IDs are assigned by the industry standards body and must be used instead of the Plug and Play IDs described in this article.\n\nGiven the above, it doesn't strike me like a good idea for the API to rely on a proprietary Microsoft thing - unless there is a valid use case for it. \n",
